{
    "title": "Does He Like Me?",
    "description": "Test if you crush loves you with this Love Tester quiz app! \r\n\r\nLooking to find out if someone you know loves you? If you are, this love test calculator app is exactly what you are looking for.\r\n\r\nAnswer ten questions and our unique algorithm with calculate the love compatibility as an percentage. There is a total of 12 different love test quizzes for girls to try out! \r\n\r\nDoes he really love you? Is it love or just friendship? Find it out with our Love Test today and share the love calculator results with family or friends.\r\n\r\nThis Love Calculator app enables you calculate the probability of a successful relationship between two people and is a fun game to play with your BFF friends.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Give our girls Love Test Calculator a try! Install the Love Tester today and start using our calculator to check who your best love match is.\r\n\r\nPlease note this app/game has been developed only for entertainment purposes and has no intention to hurt the user feelings. The application uses numerical algorithm to calculate the love match and should be used only for fun.\r\n\r\nWe hope you enjoy this love test app. This is a fun app for girls. If you have any suggestion on how you think we can improve this love game please let us know!",
